title: Workers' Defense Committees
new-page: true
view-if: ugt_defense_timer <= 0 and year >= 1934
on-arrival: ugt_defense_timer = 9; month_actions += 1
frequency: 150
is-card: true
card-image: img/que_has_fet.jpg
tags: ugt_affairs

= Workers' Defense Committees

In response to armed attacks by Falangist squads and Carlist Requetés, UGT local branches have formed self-defense groups. These groups protect strike pickets, guard union headquarters, and retaliate against far-right violence.They are linked to the Juventudes Socialistas.

- @expand_militia: Arm and expand the Defense Committees alongside the Juventudes Socialistas.
- @target_falange: Direct paramilitary operations against Falange.
- @target_requete: Direct paramilitary operations against the Carlist Requetés.
- @cnt_cooperation: Seek tactical cooperation with the CNT.
- @root: Stand down for now.

@expand_militia
subtitle: -1 UGT Resource
choose-if: ugt_resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough UGT resources.
on-arrival: ugt_resources -= 1; js_strength += 15; js_militancy += 0.05; prietistas_dissent += 3;

We allocate union funds to procure guns and tactical training for UGT and Juventudes Socialistas members. The reformist wing warns that arming workers risks inviting a military backlash.

@target_falange
subtitle: -1 UGT Resource
choose-if: ugt_resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough UGT resources.
on-arrival: ugt_resources -= 1; mf_strength -= 20*js_militancy; js_strength -= 20*mf_militancy; js_militancy += 0.03; middle_psoe -= 3; prietistas_dissent += 4; street_violence += 1; polarization += 5; pro_republic -= 3 if street_violence >= 2; coup_progress += 1 if street_violence >= 4; guardia_asalto_loyalty -= 0.07

Socialist squads clash directly with Falangist militants in street brawls and gunfights. While Falange operational capacity is disrupted, street violence escalates sharply.

@target_requete
subtitle: -1 UGT Resource
choose-if: ugt_resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough UGT resources.
on-arrival: ugt_resources -= 1; rc_strength -= 20*js_militancy; js_strength -= 20*rc_militancy; js_militancy += 0.03; middle_psoe -= 3; prietistas_dissent += 4; street_violence += 1; polarization += 5; pro_republic -= 3 if street_violence >= 2; coup_progress += 1 if street_violence >= 4; guardia_civil_loyalty -= 0.07

Socialist squads clash directly with Carlist militants in street brawls and gunfights. While Carlist operational capacity is disrupted, street violence escalates sharply.

@cnt_cooperation
subtitle: Build a unified working-class defense front with the CNT.
choose-if: cnt_relation >= 30
unavailable-subtitle: Relations with the CNT are too strained for paramilitary cooperation.
on-arrival: cnt_cooperation = 1; cnt_relation += 10; js_militancy += 0.05; ma_militancy += 0.05;

Overcoming decades of hostility, UGT and CNT local defense committees agree to share intelligence, coordinate strike security, and jointly counter fascists.
